// LSP module-loading fixture (M2.6) — exercised by tools/check-lsp.sh. Opening a file that imports a std
// module must resolve that module's exports (no false "does not export"). Kept tiny + stable; the imported
// DynamicArray is referenced in a signature, which is enough to exercise import resolution.
// A file in a loose build's ROOT is in no module, so it is file-private (design/module-system.md §2e.27).

import { std::collections::DynamicArray };

